      'Use only information visible in deckFront, deckBack, or visibleStudyLayers. If a key detail is missing, mark needsDeckEdit instead of inventing it.',
      'Prefer Bible Excerpt evidence when it exists; Context, Scholarly Note, and Moral Problem can support framing.',
